{"product_id":"vgod-nicotine-salt-lush-ice","title":"VGOD Nicotine Salt - Lush Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003eA perfect choice for those who enjoy juicy and refreshing iced fruit flavors, VGOD’s Lush Ice Nic Salt Juice serves up a mouthwatering flavor profile that will keep your tastebuds happy, regardless of this season. Try VGOD’s Lush Ice Nic Salt Juice today if you enjoy succulent, smooth, and icy watermelon flavors.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVGOD’s Lush Ice Nic Salt Juice comes in a 30ml bottle of nicotine salt juice with your choice between a 25mg (2.5%) and 50mg (5.0%) nicotine strength. Not simping for Lush Ice? Be sure to check out VGOD’s full selection of nicotine salt juices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNic Salt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: VGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: Lush Ice Salt Nic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 55\/45\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: \u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWatermelon \u0026amp; mint\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Salt Nicotine\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 25mg \/ 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"25mg","offer_id":41670490980407,"sku":"VGOD - Lush Ice - 25","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670491013175,"sku":"VGOD - Lush Ice - 50 mg","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod-lush-ice-30ml-nic-salt-juice.jpg?v=1747701693","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vgod-nicotine-salt-lush-ice","provider":